# Git repository metadata
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# IDE and Editor files
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.user
**/*.suo
**/*.userosscache
**/*.sln.docstates

# Build artifacts & compilation output (prevents copying host binaries into Linux container)
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Test output and code coverage reports
**/TestResults/

# Documentation and markdown files (not needed inside runtime container)
*.md
docs/

# Environment files and credentials (security protection)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
